<title>JAPAN: Fuji Elec Constr - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuji Elec Constr - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		     15.17		vs	   14.01</p>
<p> Operating	   25    million	  vs	  113    million</p>
<p> Current	     24    million	  vs	   61    million</p>
<p> Net		   11    million	  vs	   46    million</p>
<p> EPS			  0.64 yen	  vs	    3.55 yen</p>
<p> Shares		   18 million	  vs	  13 million</p>
<p> Interim div		3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fuji Electric Construction Co Ltd is the full company name.</p>
